The Capability Environment is responsible for transforming every COREI business function into a reusable, governed, independently deployable institutional capability.

Unlike the previous phases, this phase is implementation-centric.

Its primary outcome is a repository containing production-ready capability infrastructure rather than additional architectural documentation.

